WEBVTT

00:00:18.300 --> 00:00:20.270
Those idiots...

00:00:20.270 --> 00:00:22.870
If the Type-X didn't have
any effect on that thing,

00:00:22.870 --> 00:00:25.870
what do they think conventional weapons can do?

00:00:25.870 --> 00:00:28.870
Thanatos will be disappearing behind Earth soon.

00:00:28.870 --> 00:00:31.110
Sigelinde, are you done yet?

00:00:31.110 --> 00:00:32.910
Just a little bit longer...

00:00:32.910 --> 00:00:35.910
Man, they may have a one-pattern defense,

00:00:35.910 --> 00:00:38.320
but there sure are a lot of them!

00:00:38.320 --> 00:00:41.320
- Please hurry.
- You don't have to tell me.

00:00:41.320 --> 00:00:46.220
It's irritating just having to look at
this inelegant, uninventive program!

00:00:46.220 --> 00:00:49.630
Keep in mind, I'm going to
re-write the whole thing later!

00:01:09.150 --> 00:01:14.850
Osanai hi ni nakushita

00:01:14.850 --> 00:01:20.760
sono itami no imi sae

00:01:20.760 --> 00:01:26.500
Uzumakumatte takushita

00:01:26.500 --> 00:01:29.700
Boku wa kitto...

00:01:31.100 --> 00:01:37.440
Ao no hate ni mita yokan wo toraete

00:01:37.440 --> 00:01:44.950
kaze ni nori hikari no sasu hou e

00:01:44.950 --> 00:01:47.820
I'll always be with you

00:01:47.820 --> 00:01:50.460
see the sky in front of you

00:01:50.460 --> 00:01:54.820
fly high in a light from the deepest blue

00:01:56.530 --> 00:02:02.000
Uzumaku hoshi no hibiki ni nosete

00:02:02.000 --> 00:02:04.670
utau yo

00:02:04.670 --> 00:02:13.340
Kono koe ga kimi ni todokimasu you ni

00:02:28.860 --> 00:02:31.330
Final deceleration complete.

00:02:31.330 --> 00:02:33.370
You're sure about this, Jin?

00:02:33.370 --> 00:02:35.530
Yeah. Thanks.

00:02:35.530 --> 00:02:40.240
Hey, I am the one who
spanked you so hard, after all.

00:02:40.240 --> 00:02:41.710
Kazuki...

00:02:41.710 --> 00:02:45.540
Jin, you come back, now.

00:02:45.540 --> 00:02:47.850
I don't know what's going on in there,

00:02:47.850 --> 00:02:51.580
or what's going to happen from here on.

00:02:51.580 --> 00:02:53.550
Not to mention what's happened to Toa,

00:02:53.550 --> 00:02:56.550
or what you're going to say to her.

00:02:56.550 --> 00:03:03.360
But you come back. You have to come back.

00:03:03.360 --> 00:03:07.030
Yeah. I'm coming back to Earth.

00:03:07.030 --> 00:03:08.730
Together with Toa!

00:03:09.700 --> 00:03:11.900
Submit!

00:03:17.940 --> 00:03:21.410
I have complete control of the Aegis system!

00:03:21.410 --> 00:03:24.150
Most impressive, Young Miss.

00:03:24.150 --> 00:03:26.810
Okay, shall we get started?

00:03:35.460 --> 00:03:38.600
Reflector array angle adjustment complete.

00:03:38.600 --> 00:03:40.930
Aegis operation confirmed.

00:03:40.930 --> 00:03:45.900
120 seconds until Thanatos enters firing range.

00:03:45.900 --> 00:03:48.630
Tracking system contact.

00:03:51.140 --> 00:03:55.310
Power charge and oscillation
pulse rate input complete.

00:03:57.650 --> 00:04:00.820
Mirror error correction 0.03!

00:04:00.820 --> 00:04:03.760
Error correction 0.03.

00:04:03.760 --> 00:04:05.990
Engaging Aegis.

00:04:07.690 --> 00:04:11.530
CSS Fresnel lenses,
power boosters, choking field,

00:04:11.530 --> 00:04:13.690
all systems go!

00:04:22.040 --> 00:04:25.610
Avenir successfully charging CSS waves.

00:04:25.610 --> 00:04:26.880
What's the output?

00:04:26.880 --> 00:04:29.980
Currently passing 80%, and rising.

00:04:29.980 --> 00:04:32.320
- We don't need that much.
- Huh?

00:04:32.320 --> 00:04:35.510
Set output at 27%.

00:04:36.720 --> 00:04:42.290
Don't forget, our purpose
is not to attack Thanatos.

00:04:42.290 --> 00:04:44.300
All right...

00:04:44.300 --> 00:04:50.840
Is it really possible to use Aegis
as a communication tool?

00:04:50.840 --> 00:04:53.470
You are aware that CSS waves are distinguished

00:04:53.470 --> 00:04:56.470
by a Dragon's sensory organs.

00:04:56.470 --> 00:04:58.810
Aegis is a weapon.

00:04:58.810 --> 00:05:01.750
Vibrations in the air are
explosive if they are powerful,

00:05:01.750 --> 00:05:04.420
but if they are smaller,
they become sounds or voices.

00:05:04.420 --> 00:05:07.490
It's a little harsh, but unless we do this,

00:05:07.490 --> 00:05:11.320
that behemoth out there isn't likely to listen.

00:05:11.320 --> 00:05:15.430
But is there any proof that
our words will get through to it?

00:05:15.430 --> 00:05:18.730
There isn't any proof. However,

00:05:18.730 --> 00:05:20.670
there is a Dragon in there

00:05:20.670 --> 00:05:23.230
that has gone through Resonance with a human.

00:05:25.500 --> 00:05:27.010
Gio, huh?

00:05:27.010 --> 00:05:30.600
60 seconds until Thanatos
appears from behind the Earth.

00:05:35.280 --> 00:05:38.080
All systems are in order.

00:05:38.080 --> 00:05:40.890
10 more seconds... 8...

00:05:40.890 --> 00:05:42.890
7... 6...

00:05:42.890 --> 00:05:45.860
5... 4... 3...

00:05:45.860 --> 00:05:48.060
2... 1...

00:05:48.060 --> 00:05:50.050
Commence irradiation!

00:06:15.950 --> 00:06:18.920
Answer us, Thanatos.

00:06:18.920 --> 00:06:22.730
Listen... listen to what we have to say,

00:06:22.730 --> 00:06:24.500
Thanatos.

00:06:24.500 --> 00:06:26.260
What is this?

00:06:36.740 --> 00:06:39.680
Where are we?

00:06:39.680 --> 00:06:41.110
Earth?

00:06:41.110 --> 00:06:42.680
I get it. This is...

00:06:42.680 --> 00:06:45.750
Where is this place?

00:06:45.750 --> 00:06:47.120
Is that?

00:06:47.120 --> 00:06:49.190
Is this the next world?

00:06:49.190 --> 00:06:51.760
Please, don't even say anything like that!

00:06:51.760 --> 00:06:55.030
I don't have a boyfriend yet!
I don't want to die!

00:06:55.030 --> 00:06:56.760
You keep quiet, too!

00:06:56.760 --> 00:06:58.590
Hey!

00:06:59.630 --> 00:07:01.460
Little man!

00:07:02.800 --> 00:07:04.640
What are you all doing here?

00:07:04.640 --> 00:07:08.640
We could ask you the same thing.
What are you doing here?

00:07:08.640 --> 00:07:13.810
Indeed. After all, this is...

00:07:13.810 --> 00:07:17.280
The inside of Thanatos, right?

00:07:17.280 --> 00:07:19.440
That is correct.

00:07:23.790 --> 00:07:28.330
Akira! Machina! You're alive?!

00:07:28.330 --> 00:07:31.660
Interesting device you've created.

00:07:31.660 --> 00:07:35.530
Who would have thought that
CSS could be used like this?

00:07:35.530 --> 00:07:37.240
When you back humans up against a wall,

00:07:37.240 --> 00:07:40.670
you never know what they're going to do.

00:07:40.670 --> 00:07:44.040
What are you two talking about?

00:07:44.040 --> 00:07:47.750
That is not Akira and Machina.

00:07:47.750 --> 00:07:50.320
He is correct, Young Miss.

00:07:50.320 --> 00:07:53.820
I guess the plan worked, Raina.

00:07:53.820 --> 00:07:56.550
- So it seems.
- Lt did?

00:07:56.550 --> 00:07:59.860
Then, those two are Thanatos?

00:07:59.860 --> 00:08:02.360
Hmm, not exactly.

00:08:02.360 --> 00:08:05.660
Thanatos is a boundless
aggregate of consciousnesses.

00:08:05.660 --> 00:08:08.370
We are nothing more than a portion of it.

00:08:08.370 --> 00:08:10.900
Yes, we are tiny beings,

00:08:10.900 --> 00:08:14.670
floating along on a vast
sea of consciousness. Still...

00:08:14.670 --> 00:08:17.580
...the time is near when
we will dissolve into the sea.

00:08:17.580 --> 00:08:20.410
Yes, very soon now.

00:08:26.080 --> 00:08:28.450
You wanted to talk to us, right, Raina?

00:08:28.450 --> 00:08:33.460
Let's hear it. That is why we had you come here.

00:08:33.460 --> 00:08:36.630
Yeah, right.

00:08:36.630 --> 00:08:41.530
Thanatos, we want you to stop
any further interference with Earth.

00:08:41.530 --> 00:08:43.970
- Why?
- Why, you ask?!

00:08:43.970 --> 00:08:45.970
Because when that massive
a heavenly body gets so close...

00:08:45.970 --> 00:08:49.610
- Young Miss...
...it's going to have a huge
effect on Earth, of course!

00:08:49.610 --> 00:08:52.280
We fought together, didn't we?

00:08:52.280 --> 00:08:54.750
How can you say that now?!

00:08:54.750 --> 00:08:59.050
The Dragonauts. I do indeed
have memories of that.

00:08:59.050 --> 00:09:04.390
But we are no longer your colleagues.

00:09:04.390 --> 00:09:07.290
That's okay. You don't
have to be our colleagues.

00:09:07.290 --> 00:09:10.800
But can't you still deal with us as friends?

00:09:10.800 --> 00:09:16.430
If Thanatos' goal is to recover
the Dragon eggs, we will assist, so...

00:09:16.430 --> 00:09:19.800
Raina, it doesn't really matter what happens

00:09:19.800 --> 00:09:21.570
to those contaminated eggs now.

00:09:21.570 --> 00:09:25.610
Contaminated?! You say that like
people are some sort of germ!

00:09:25.610 --> 00:09:28.480
Resonance with humans was a mistake.

00:09:28.480 --> 00:09:31.620
They steal from and hurt
others of their own kind.

00:09:31.620 --> 00:09:35.290
Humans truly are a foolish species.

00:09:35.290 --> 00:09:39.020
We don't want any Dragon that has
gone through Resonance with them.

00:09:39.020 --> 00:09:41.130
Why, you!

00:09:41.130 --> 00:09:43.160
It's no use, Howling Star.

00:09:43.160 --> 00:09:45.260
Mother does not want any more Dragons

00:09:45.260 --> 00:09:49.130
to be contaminated by humans. Thus,

00:09:49.130 --> 00:09:52.770
it has decided to eliminate humans,
the source of the contamination.

00:09:52.770 --> 00:09:54.870
What?!

00:09:54.870 --> 00:09:57.440
That's quite an arbitrary thing to say.

00:09:57.440 --> 00:09:59.310
You came to Earth,
without any of us asking you to,

00:09:59.310 --> 00:10:01.150
and now you're going to destroy humanity

00:10:01.150 --> 00:10:03.650
because we contaminate Dragons?
How tyrannical.

00:10:03.650 --> 00:10:06.280
Which one of us is arbitrary?

00:10:06.280 --> 00:10:10.320
You believe that Earth belongs
to mankind, without any doubt.

00:10:10.320 --> 00:10:12.890
How is it that you don't
realize that line of thinking

00:10:12.890 --> 00:10:14.790
is what contaminated the Dragons?

00:10:14.790 --> 00:10:17.630
It's too bad, Raina.

00:10:17.630 --> 00:10:19.860
Wait! Thanatos!

00:10:23.370 --> 00:10:27.970
Kazuki! Raina-san! Sigelinde!
Where are you all?!

00:10:27.970 --> 00:10:29.560
Jin...

00:10:32.180 --> 00:10:33.970
Come with me.

00:10:40.990 --> 00:10:43.750
We're back?

00:10:43.750 --> 00:10:46.590
Where's Jin? Jin's not here!

00:10:47.660 --> 00:10:50.390
Is he still over there?

00:10:53.500 --> 00:10:55.600
Thanatos has altered its orbit!

00:10:55.600 --> 00:10:58.190
At this rate, it will collide with Earth!

00:11:21.760 --> 00:11:23.730
Toa?

00:11:23.730 --> 00:11:25.360
Jin!

00:11:27.900 --> 00:11:29.470
Toa!

00:11:29.470 --> 00:11:30.800
Answer me!

00:11:30.800 --> 00:11:34.570
- Toa!
- I'm right here!

00:11:34.570 --> 00:11:37.210
Jin...

00:11:37.210 --> 00:11:41.050
What's going on here, Gio?!
I thought Toa was supposed to live!

00:11:41.050 --> 00:11:43.210
Toa is alive.

00:11:44.820 --> 00:11:46.280
She's alive?

00:11:46.280 --> 00:11:53.490
Yes. Toa is alive. She will live
on forever, as one with Thanatos.

00:11:53.490 --> 00:11:55.330
You can't mean...

00:11:55.330 --> 00:11:58.560
This is what you call living?

00:11:59.930 --> 00:12:02.500
I'm sorry, Toa.

00:12:02.500 --> 00:12:04.940
I didn't know this would happen.

00:12:04.940 --> 00:12:10.780
You said you wanted to be with me, and I... I...

00:12:10.780 --> 00:12:12.470
Jin...

00:12:16.750 --> 00:12:18.340
Jin!

00:12:19.920 --> 00:12:22.520
Gio!

00:12:22.520 --> 00:12:26.690
I'm going to release your consciousness
from the yoke of your body, Jin.

00:12:26.690 --> 00:12:28.160
What are you talking about?!

00:12:28.160 --> 00:12:31.360
Merge with Thanatos. By doing so,

00:12:31.360 --> 00:12:34.500
you can be released from both time and space,

00:12:34.500 --> 00:12:37.670
dissolve into Toa, and become one.

00:12:37.670 --> 00:12:40.330
You can spend eternity together.

00:12:46.010 --> 00:12:49.950
Is Thanatos serious about destroying mankind?

00:12:49.950 --> 00:12:52.480
We're done for.

00:12:52.480 --> 00:12:53.850
Not yet!

00:12:53.850 --> 00:12:58.020
We still have Jin! I'm sure
he's meeting with Gio!

00:12:58.020 --> 00:13:02.060
Jin will be able to do something!
Something that we couldn't!

00:13:02.060 --> 00:13:05.560
Something like what?

00:13:05.560 --> 00:13:10.970
I don't know. But if we give up, it's all over.

00:13:10.970 --> 00:13:13.670
I don't want to have any regrets.

00:13:13.670 --> 00:13:17.900
So right now, I'll do what I can as best I can!

00:13:19.640 --> 00:13:21.240
Jin...

00:13:31.320 --> 00:13:33.360
Jin!

00:13:33.360 --> 00:13:34.760
Don't be afraid.

00:13:34.760 --> 00:13:37.660
It's not that I'm afraid!

00:13:37.660 --> 00:13:40.330
Becoming one with Thanatos would mean that

00:13:40.330 --> 00:13:43.500
I wouldn't be me anymore, right?

00:13:43.500 --> 00:13:46.570
That Toa wouldn't be Toa anymore, right?

00:13:46.570 --> 00:13:50.880
Neither Toa nor I want that!

00:13:50.880 --> 00:13:55.050
Remember back when me, you, and Toa

00:13:55.050 --> 00:13:59.520
all lived together in that hideaway.

00:13:59.520 --> 00:14:03.890
The three of us, together,
had a good time, right?

00:14:03.890 --> 00:14:05.090
Yeah.

00:14:05.090 --> 00:14:09.060
That's because the three
of us were different people.

00:14:09.060 --> 00:14:12.560
I said that your cooking needed more seasoning,

00:14:12.560 --> 00:14:14.470
but Toa said that it was too salty, right?

00:14:14.470 --> 00:14:15.630
What about it?

00:14:15.630 --> 00:14:18.740
Different people can sense
the same thing in different ways.

00:14:18.740 --> 00:14:20.940
Yes, they feel!

00:14:20.940 --> 00:14:24.080
They feel the breeze on their skin,
smell the aromas of the season,

00:14:24.080 --> 00:14:27.140
get sweaty when they work, bathe, then sleep.

00:14:27.140 --> 00:14:30.110
That's what it is to be alive, right?

00:14:36.790 --> 00:14:39.660
I know. However,

00:14:39.660 --> 00:14:43.430
this is the only way to extend Toa's life.

00:14:43.430 --> 00:14:47.470
You're wrong, Gio! This isn't what we want!

00:14:47.470 --> 00:14:51.600
Are you saying you don't want eternal life?

00:14:51.600 --> 00:14:57.010
No, I don't. I just want to be with Jin,
even if only for a moment.

00:14:57.010 --> 00:15:00.310
You can be with him, the way we are.

00:15:00.310 --> 00:15:05.020
Together forever, without the
torment of the fear of death.

00:15:05.020 --> 00:15:10.090
It's not that we fear death.
It is because people die

00:15:10.090 --> 00:15:14.130
that the time we're alive...
that each and every moment

00:15:14.130 --> 00:15:17.160
we're with the ones we love shines.

00:15:17.160 --> 00:15:19.500
I learned that by coming to Earth,

00:15:19.500 --> 00:15:22.800
and going through Resonance with Jin.

00:15:22.800 --> 00:15:25.600
Are you saying that death is wonderful?

00:15:25.600 --> 00:15:29.330
No. Living is wonderful.

00:15:31.140 --> 00:15:35.850
But that man doesn't seem to think so.

00:15:35.850 --> 00:15:40.820
Toa... rather, the Album,
like the Atrum and the Raum,

00:15:40.820 --> 00:15:44.050
are Dragons that were created to
check on how the eggs were doing.

00:15:44.050 --> 00:15:45.360
Check on them?

00:15:45.360 --> 00:15:47.860
Yes. Once their purpose was accomplished,

00:15:47.860 --> 00:15:50.530
they were to return to Thanatos immediately.

00:15:50.530 --> 00:15:55.370
Without going through
Resonance, of course. However...

00:15:55.370 --> 00:15:57.360
Then that accident happened.

00:16:02.040 --> 00:16:07.810
Yes. And then, all three of them
went through Resonance with humans.

00:16:13.350 --> 00:16:16.090
Thanatos is angry about that, huh?

00:16:16.090 --> 00:16:18.360
- Angry?
- Am I wrong?

00:16:18.360 --> 00:16:20.690
To Thanatos, Toa and the others

00:16:20.690 --> 00:16:24.330
are like hairs that have fallen from its head.

00:16:24.330 --> 00:16:27.830
It doesn't matter to Thanatos
whether or not Toa dies.

00:16:27.830 --> 00:16:31.000
That's why he came to appeal to Mother.

00:16:31.000 --> 00:16:32.670
To allow you to merge once again,

00:16:32.670 --> 00:16:35.270
in exchange for him becoming the successor.

00:16:35.270 --> 00:16:37.340
But then, Gio would be...

00:16:37.340 --> 00:16:41.450
He knew that better than anyone.

00:16:41.450 --> 00:16:43.880
Jin, merge with Thanatos.

00:16:43.880 --> 00:16:47.020
By doing so, you can be
together with Toa forever.

00:16:47.020 --> 00:16:48.920
No!

00:16:48.920 --> 00:16:51.920
I finally understand how Toa feels.

00:16:51.920 --> 00:16:54.930
I want to be with Toa, if only for a moment!

00:16:54.930 --> 00:16:57.800
To live together, and then,

00:16:57.800 --> 00:17:00.760
after we share some of the same time...

00:17:00.760 --> 00:17:03.870
Jin, I feel the same way.

00:17:03.870 --> 00:17:05.100
It's no use.

00:17:05.100 --> 00:17:07.810
The merging of consciousness
between you and Thanatos

00:17:07.810 --> 00:17:10.310
has already begun.

00:17:10.310 --> 00:17:11.980
Oh, no!

00:17:11.980 --> 00:17:13.910
Wait, Mother!

00:17:13.910 --> 00:17:18.150
Not to worry. Jin will be merged soon.

00:17:18.150 --> 00:17:21.390
I'm not ready yet!

00:17:21.390 --> 00:17:24.720
- Me...
- Me...

00:17:24.720 --> 00:17:26.060
...and Toa...

00:17:26.060 --> 00:17:28.330
...and Jin...

00:17:28.330 --> 00:17:30.260
...want to be together!

00:17:50.650 --> 00:17:52.420
I'm sorry, Toa.

00:17:52.420 --> 00:17:54.010
Mm-mm.

00:17:55.520 --> 00:18:00.010
I won't let you go again. I'm staying
with you, right up to the end.

00:18:02.690 --> 00:18:06.160
Mother, I'm staying with Jin!

00:18:06.160 --> 00:18:09.360
The two of us are staying together,
until our final moment!

00:18:17.640 --> 00:18:20.040
How fascinating.

00:18:20.040 --> 00:18:22.510
One who was born from a piece of Mother

00:18:22.510 --> 00:18:25.020
now says something that
Mother cannot comprehend.

00:18:25.020 --> 00:18:29.020
And all of it as a result of
Resonance with a human.

00:18:29.020 --> 00:18:32.620
Mother has reconsidered.

00:18:32.620 --> 00:18:35.030
It will no longer destroy humanity.

00:18:35.030 --> 00:18:36.160
Then...

00:18:36.160 --> 00:18:40.660
It has decided that humans are
creatures that are worth merging with.

00:18:40.660 --> 00:18:45.070
Mother wishes to merge with all of humanity.

00:18:48.140 --> 00:18:51.130
- What's that?!
- Thanatos is waking up.

00:18:52.210 --> 00:18:56.310
This space will collapse soon.
Both of you are getting out of here.

00:18:56.310 --> 00:18:57.580
Gio?

00:18:57.580 --> 00:19:00.080
You're going to be together
until the last moment, right?

00:19:00.080 --> 00:19:02.750
In that case, you have no time to hesitate.

00:19:02.750 --> 00:19:05.590
Gio, what you're doing for us...

00:19:05.590 --> 00:19:07.060
It's okay, Toa.

00:19:07.060 --> 00:19:09.660
But!

00:19:09.660 --> 00:19:11.390
Let's go, Jin!

00:19:26.880 --> 00:19:30.250
Reading irregularities in Thanatos.
What in the world?!

00:19:30.250 --> 00:19:32.370
I-Is that?

00:19:39.060 --> 00:19:40.680
A Dragon!

00:19:49.070 --> 00:19:52.470
Multiple objects have been
released from Thanatos.

00:19:52.470 --> 00:19:55.110
They're... Ostrums!

00:19:55.110 --> 00:19:59.130
- What?!
- There are too many of them to count!

00:20:00.380 --> 00:20:02.080
Let's go, Raina.

00:20:02.080 --> 00:20:06.280
This is a fitting stage for
one last, royal battle, isn't it?

00:20:09.090 --> 00:20:12.590
But if we launch an attack,
the Avenir will be...

00:20:12.590 --> 00:20:15.290
- Please, go, Captain!
- Kazuki...

00:20:15.290 --> 00:20:18.320
I will defend the Avenir.

00:20:20.100 --> 00:20:22.470
You're on.

00:20:22.470 --> 00:20:25.640
You sure have grown up, huh?

00:20:25.640 --> 00:20:28.830
Lucky for you, you met Widow.

00:20:31.440 --> 00:20:33.180
Yes.

00:20:33.180 --> 00:20:35.150
We have a special news bulletin.

00:20:35.150 --> 00:20:37.510
A change has just appeared in Thanatos,

00:20:37.510 --> 00:20:39.480
which had been parked in the Moon's orbit.

00:20:39.480 --> 00:20:39.820
"Breaking... Multiple Dragons
incoming from Thanatos!!"
Which had been parked in the Moon's orbit.

00:20:39.820 --> 00:20:42.690
"Breaking... Multiple Dragons
incoming from Thanatos!!"
Thanatos has now changed its form,

00:20:42.690 --> 00:20:44.790
"Breaking... Multiple Dragons
incoming from Thanatos!!"
And has released a large number of Dragons.

00:20:44.790 --> 00:20:45.290
And has released a large number of Dragons.

00:20:45.290 --> 00:20:49.330
UN forces have declared a state of emergency...

00:20:49.330 --> 00:20:51.160
You are leaving, aren't you?

00:20:51.160 --> 00:20:52.790
Yeah.

00:20:57.700 --> 00:21:01.640
I won't stop you. You've made
up your mind to do this.

00:21:01.640 --> 00:21:03.300
I'm sorry.

00:21:19.860 --> 00:21:23.560
That was mean, Professor Nozaki.

00:21:23.560 --> 00:21:27.620
Now, we have no chance of winning, do we?

00:21:31.670 --> 00:21:33.330
Just a minute, Gio!

00:21:34.570 --> 00:21:36.640
There's still something we have to do.

00:21:36.640 --> 00:21:40.980
- What is it?
- I want to talk to Thanatos again.

00:21:40.980 --> 00:21:44.410
Toa, will you come with me?

00:21:44.410 --> 00:21:46.010
Mm-hmm.

00:22:19.420 --> 00:22:21.690
Hakisuteta kotoba no imi sae

00:22:21.690 --> 00:22:23.950
fukaku kangaetari wa shinai

00:22:23.950 --> 00:22:28.290
ima wo tada nigekiru dake

00:22:28.290 --> 00:22:30.560
Mata nannimo nakatta you ni

00:22:30.560 --> 00:22:32.700
onaji koto wo kurikaeshite'ru

00:22:32.700 --> 00:22:36.370
Muimi nano yo mata sonna nige

00:22:36.370 --> 00:22:45.240
Kekkyoku youchi de kodomo no manma da ne

00:22:45.240 --> 00:22:54.650
Hitori yogari kako no jibun wa mou sute na

00:22:54.650 --> 00:22:59.160
Tadashii tatakai wa
sou kimi no naka de hajimaru

00:22:59.160 --> 00:23:03.590
Kimi nara dou suru? Mou girigiri ja nai?

00:23:03.590 --> 00:23:08.670
Houkai shite shimau mae ni arubeki sugata wo

00:23:08.670 --> 00:23:15.770
omoiokoshite mite mi na yo

00:23:15.770 --> 00:23:21.900
Fight or flight

00:23:24.580 --> 00:23:29.350
Fight or flight

00:23:43.470 --> 00:23:46.600
Thinking back, it's been a long michinori.
[Michinori = "journey"]

00:23:46.600 --> 00:23:49.810
It seems short, and yet long,

00:23:49.810 --> 00:23:52.010
but it really was short, huh?

00:23:52.010 --> 00:23:54.480
Speaking of michinori, nori laver
sure is delicious, isn't it?

00:23:54.480 --> 00:23:57.010
Yeah, yeah, you can't get by without nori.

00:23:57.010 --> 00:23:59.180
Are you sure this is the
note we should go out on?

00:23:59.180 --> 00:24:02.020
You've got to have enthusiasm,
or you can't win the final conflict!

00:24:02.020 --> 00:24:04.620
Yeah, yeah, let's use this
momentum and win this thing!

00:24:04.620 --> 00:24:07.520
Next time, the denouement!
